{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f5a33bc5-4a49-8b6c-a931-f9248027b978",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T13:09:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. This is Aisha Mensah. I'm calling about a pothole. I was trying to report it on the city app, the one my neighbor told me about, but it froze on me, so I'll have to restart it later. Anyway, I figured I'd just call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can take it over the phone. Where's the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 372 Gidley Street. That's where I live. Now, I've been on this street a long time, and the road has always had its bumps, my landlord says the same, but this one is different. It is deep enough to swallow a tire. A whole tire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a deep one. Is it right in the travel lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Near the edge, in front of the house. And it's full of water from the melting, so you can't see it. It just looks like a puddle. Somebody is going to drive right into it. Where was I, yes, that's the main thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'm logging it now as 372 Gidley, deep pothole filled with water, hard to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Can I ask, how long does it usually take for it to get fixed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:09:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the backlog, but a hazard like that gets prioritized. Usually days rather than weeks. I'll flag it for the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That's good. Thank you, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:09:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
